<title>HUNGARY: Hungary six-month T-bill yield drops to 20.64 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary six-month T-bill yield drops to 20.64 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of six-month discount Treasury bills was set by auction at 20.64 percent, down from 20.71 percent at an auction two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     17,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	33,936.74 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    17,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 18,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    20.64 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     90.6686 pct</p>
</text>
